  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Dobrovo&#x13e;n&#xed;k/-&#x10d;ka pre podporu v&#x10d;el&#xe1;rstva v Libanone</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Volunteer for supporting a beekeeping in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Dobrovo&#x13e;n&#xed;k/-&#x10d;ka bude ma&#x165; na starosti podporu v&#x10d;el&#xe1;rskej produkcie a s t&#xfd;m spojenej potravinovej sieti (value chain) v&#xfd;roby a distrib&#xfa;cie medu najzranite&#x13e;nej&#x161;&#xed;m skupin&#xe1;m z libanonsk&#xfd;ch a ute&#x10d;eneck&#xfd;ch komun&#xed;t. Dobrovo&#x13e;n&#xed;k/-&#x10d;ka bude koordinova&#x165; kooperat&#xed;vu/zdru&#x17e;enie &#x17e;ien &#x2013; v&#x10d;el&#xe1;rok a podporova&#x165; budovanie kapac&#xed;t a organiz&#xe1;ciu &#x161;pecializovan&#xfd;ch tr&#xe9;ningov pre tieto podnikate&#x13e;ky. Dobrovo&#x13e;n&#xed;k/-&#x10d;ka bude taktie&#x17e; rozv&#xed;ja&#x165; sie&#x165; kontaktov, partnersk&#xfd;ch a donorsk&#xfd;ch organiz&#xe1;ci&#xed; zameran&#xfd;ch na podporu &#x17e;ivobytia, potravinovej sebesta&#x10d;nosti a ekologick&#xe9;ho po&#x13e;nohospod&#xe1;rstva.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The volunteer will be in charge of supporting beekeeping production and the associated food chain (value chain) of honey production and distribution to the most vulnerable groups in the Lebanese and refugee communities. The volunteer will coordinate the cooperation of female beekeepers and support capacity building and the organization of specialized trainings for these women entrepreneurs. The volunteer will also develop a network of contacts, partners and donors aimed at promoting livelihoods, food self-sufficiency and organic farming.</narrative>
  </description>
